        "TileImage": "$($repository bf60280b-9b3b-4837-a90e-8cbcfe46d515).Image",
        "Description": "Good job 47\r\rNow we know more about project Epsilon, which is being lead by the Inquisitor. Blue Blood has launched this project in Miami, where Maxwell Rutter is in charge. They are trying to let Moses Lee win, so that he can make his way into a bigger  tournament in Qatar. Finally, Derek Mcginnis is a researcher at Kronstadt working on project Epsilon. The entire project revolves around getting a serum to the leaders of Blue Blood, so tracking it down is beneficial.\r\rGood luck 47",
